#: apps/python/main/mod_p4.c:145
El Python de P4OS es MicroPython 1.29.\n\nEscribí una expresión y Enter:\n  2**100, sum(range(10)), 'hola'.upper()\ndef, for, if... siguen con '...'; una\n  línea vacía los corre.\nMódulos: math, random, json, re, time,\n  os, struct, collections, gc...\n  help('modules') los lista;\n  help(math) muestra uno.\nArchivos: la tarjeta es '/' y se\n  empieza en /python. open(), os e\n  import como en cualquier Python.\nRed: requests.get(url), socket.\nBibliotecas: import mip, y\n  mip.install('nombre') la baja de\n  micropython-lib a /python/lib.\nApps: cada .py de /python/apps es una\n  app del inicio que dibuja con aos.\nDetener corta lo que está corriendo.\n	P4OS's Python is MicroPython 1.29.\n\nType an expression and Enter:\n  2**100, sum(range(10)), 'hello'.upper()\ndef, for, if... go on with '...'; an\n  empty line runs them.\nModules: math, random, json, re, time,\n  os, struct, collections, gc...\n  help('modules') lists them;\n  help(math) shows one.\nFiles: the card is '/' and you start\n  in /python. open(), os and import\n  as in any Python.\nNetwork: requests.get(url), socket.\nLibraries: import mip, and\n  mip.install('name') fetches one from\n  micropython-lib into /python/lib.\nApps: every .py in /python/apps is an\n  app on the home screen, drawing with aos.\nStop interrupts what is running.\n

